<panel>
  <div background-color="rgba(0,0,0,0.9)" border-radius="20" padding="14" flex-direction="column" align-items="center" gap="6">
    <div font-size="18" font-weight="bold" color="#00ffff">HOW TO PLAY</div>
    <div flex-direction="column" gap="3" align-items="flex-start">
      <div font-size="10" color="#ffffff">-- Keyboard --</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#aaaaaa">Arrow/WASD: Steer left/right</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#aaaaaa">Space/F/J: Fire weapons</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#aaaaaa">E/Q: Drop oil slick</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#aaaaaa">R: Deploy smoke screen</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#00ccff">1: Fire EMP blast (stuns enemies)</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#00ccff">2: Deploy holographic decoy</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#ff6600">3: Nitro boost (3 charges)</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#aaaaaa">Esc/P: Pause</div>
      <div font-size="10" color="#ffffff" margin-top="4">-- VR Controller --</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#aaaaaa">Thumbstick: Steer</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#aaaaaa">Trigger: Fire</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#aaaaaa">Grip: Oil slick</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#aaaaaa">A: Smoke screen</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#aaaaaa">B: Pause</div>
      <div font-size="10" color="#ffffff" margin-top="4">-- Enemies --</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#ff4444">Sedans: Standard enemies</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#ff4444">Motorcycles: Fast, no guns</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#ff4444">Helicopters: Fly above, 2 HP</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#ff6600">Vans: Drop mines behind them</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#ff0088">Interceptors: Fast flankers</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#ff4444">Armored Boss: Every 5 waves</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#cc0000">Gunship Boss: Hovers, bullet patterns (8+ HP)</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#666666">Tank Boss: Huge, explosive shells (12+ HP, every 10 waves)</div>
      <div font-size="10" color="#ffffff" margin-top="4">-- Tips --</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#33ff33">Green cars are civilians - avoid!</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#ffff00">Collect power-ups for upgrades</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#ff00ff">Purple crates upgrade weapons</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#00ff88">Complete bonus missions for points</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#aaaaaa">Weapons: Dual - Spread - Laser</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#aaaaaa">Smoke screens block enemy fire</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#00ccff">EMP stuns + damages all nearby enemies</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#00ccff">Decoys draw enemy fire away from you</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#ff6600">Nitro gives 3s of double speed!</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#ff4400">Shoot barrels for chain explosions!</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#00ff88">Green zones give 2x score multiplier</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#ffaa00">Near-misses earn close call bonus</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#0088ff">Blue trucks are allies — dock for upgrades!</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#ffff00">Hit ramps to jump — invulnerable in air!</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#4488ff">Rain reduces visibility — stay sharp!</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#334400">Speed boost leaves oil trail that damages enemies!</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#ff00ff">Unlock car styles in Settings (wave/kill/mission milestones)</div>
      <div font-size="9" color="#aaaaaa">Chain kills for combo multiplier</div>
    </div>
    <div name="btn-tutorial-back" font-size="11" color="#ffffff" background-color="#555555" border-radius="10" padding-top="5" padding-bottom="5" padding-left="14" padding-right="14" margin-top="4" cursor="pointer">Back</div>
  </div>
</panel>
